<header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HUMAN GOLD RUSH LESSON</p><h1>LAUGH Events</h1><p class="laugh-def"><abbr title="Leaders Annual United Group Hug">LAUGH</abbr> = Leaders Annual United Group Hug — a Detente 2030 human building block / experiment.</p><p class="intro">Find or host local gatherings where trust, gratitude, future plans, and fulfillment opportunities become visible.</p><blockquote>Where can I experience community force in motion?</blockquote><div class="actions"><a href="prepare-laugh-event.html">Host an Event<span>→</span></a><a href="resources.html">Event Toolkit<span>→</span></a></div></header><section class="content-grid"><article><span>01</span><div><h2>Churches</h2><p>Host Practice FAITH conversations, potlucks, learning circles, and locally appropriate fulfillment opportunities.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h2>Merchants</h2><p>Help fulfill pledged products or services while keeping Seeking Gratitude separate from monetary settlement. Public and private sponsorships are open to any merchant or vendor wishing to donate products or services to a pending Organized Krill kit or LAUGH event.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h2>Community centers</h2><p>Provide accessible, neutral gathering places for lessons, events, observation, and reflection.</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h2>Neighbors and messengers</h2><p>Invite respectfully, deliver reliably, and accept participate, observe, or walk-away responses without pressure.</p></div></article><article><span>05</span><div><h2>Redemption Day</h2><p>Every September 1st, LAUGH events culminate in Redemption Day — kite flying, sandcastle building, and a public accounting of the year's presence, starting in 2027. It marks a settlement moment, not a payout.</p></div></article><article><span>06</span><div><h2>Open to any role</h2><p>Miners and Nuggets can attend any LAUGH event as a participant, observer, or walk-away — the same three responses, regardless of role.</p></div></article><article><span>07</span><div><h2>RSVP by QR code</h2><p>The RSVP QR begins device registration, consent, membership pledge, eligible item selection, $0 backorder, inventory reservation, and event scheduling. A LAUGH RSVP is issued only when a specific touchstone or Organized Krill Kit is available for pickup.</p></div></article><article><span>08</span><div><h2>Sponsorships, public or private</h2><p>Public or private sponsors may match products or services to confirmed requests. A Miner seller may also use YAM-is-ON for a $30 sale. Every unit is assigned to YAM-is-ON or Seeking Gratitude before acceptance and can never be counted on both rails.</p></div></article></section><section><div class="section-heading"><p>EVENT DIRECTORY</p><h2>Upcoming LAUGH events</h2></div><div class="empty-state"><div class="status-dot"></div><h3>Connect the approved event feed</h3><p>Codepixelzmedia can connect this component to the WordPress event content type. Each listing should include host, purpose, accessibility, response choices, consent note, and RSVP.</p></div></section><section class="media-section"><div class="section-heading"><p>MEDIA FOR THIS LESSON</p><h2>Watch, listen, and discuss</h2></div><div class="media-grid"><article class="media-card video"><div class="media-frame"><span>▶</span><small>VIDEO 1</small></div><h3>LAUGH Events: orientation</h3><p>Reserved for the featured story or introductory video.</p><a href="#">Transcript coming soon</a></article><article class="media-card video"><div class="media-frame"><span>▶</span><small>VIDEO 2</small></div><h3>Community conversation</h3><p>Reserved for a demonstration, conversation, or local example.</p><a href="#">Discussion guide coming soon</a></article><article class="media-card podcast"><div class="media-frame"><span>◉</span><small>PODCAST</small></div><h3>Listen and reflect</h3><p>Reserved for the facilitator or community podcast episode.</p><a href="#">Transcript coming soon</a></article></div></section>
